{title: Lord, we give You glory}
{x_theme: praise, worship, name-of-jesus}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/Lord, we give You glory.docx}

{comment: Chorus}
Lord, we give You glory.
Lord, we give You honor.
We give You all of the praise.
Lord, You’re worthy of all of the glory
And you reign in majesty.
Lord, we give you praise.

{comment: Verse 1}
We humbly bow before you in awe of who You are.
The precious rose of Sharon. You are my bright and morning star
The lily of the valley. The Lamb for sinners slain.
You are Lord of all, my King of Kings.
Lord You’re worthy of my everything
Oh Lord, we give You praise.
